    (2129288, 0, 'Get exclusive Habbo Furni for your very own Pet Monkey!'),
    (2129288, 1, ''),
    (2129288, 2, ''),
    (2129289, 0, 'Every room needs a plant! Not only do they bring a bit of the outside inside, they also enhance the air quality! And what better gift for a friend than a beautiful rose or elegant fruit tree...'),
    (2129289, 1, ''),
    (2129289, 2, ''),
    (2129291, 0, ''),
    (2129291, 1, ''),
    (2129291, 2, ''),
    (2129292, 0, 'Use these simple Furni to bring extra spice to your Wired room. These are basic Furni, so you will still need Triggers, Effects and Conditions to make them work!'),
    (2129292, 1, ''),
    (2129292, 2, ''),
    (2129293, 0, 'Move your imagination. This cool stuff is more than suitable for business and pleasure... Habbo rollers for games and queues. Now available in multipacks.'),
    (2129293, 1, 'Click on an item for details.'),
    (2129293, 2, ''),
    (2129294, 0, 'A lot of you have been asking for these. Well, they’re back! Hurray!'),
    (2129294, 1, ''),
    (2129294, 2, ''),
    (2129295, 0, 'Bigger, Better, Bouncier - it''s Battle Banzai! Now YOU set the rules for your own game, in your own room. You got the Banzai Power!'),
    (2129295, 1, ''),
    (2129295, 2, ''),
    (2129296, 0, 'Freeze!.. and try the newest game to hit Habbo! Team up and plant snowball bombs to snap freeze your competitors. You could say it''s so cool, it''s frozen ;)'),
    (2129296, 1, ''),
    (2129296, 2, ''),
    (2129297, 0, 'The High Score furni keep track of scores given in your games and displays them in your room.'),
    (2129297, 1, ''),
    (2129297, 2, ''),
    (2129298, 0, 'Whether you call it soccer, football or futbol... you can enjoy the game right here in Habbo! Get a ball and kick it, bounce it, pass it, control it and steal it!'),
    (2129298, 1, ''),
    (2129298, 2, ''),
    (2129299, 0, 'Pick up a board and hit it!'),
    (2129299, 1, ''),
    (2129299, 2, ''),
    (2129300, 0, 'WHAT THE PUCK?!  How habbos play ice hockey? You can use your imagination and play and win the World Champioship. Go for it!'),
    (2129300, 1, ''),
    (2129300, 2, ''),
    (2129301, 0, 'The fun is ON with our new game! Skate on ice and play Tag with your friends using the new Tag Pole and Ice Skating Patch! Not sure how to put on your skates? Step on an Ice Patch and you''re good to go.'),
    (2129301, 1, ''),
    (2129301, 2, 'Freeze! You''re it!'),
    (2129302, 0, 'Show off your tricks on the rink, get your derby going or just invite your friends to a good ol'' roller party! PS. the rink looks great when dressed up with some Neon or Diner Furni!'),
    (2129302, 1, ''),
    (2129302, 2, ''),
    (2129303, 0, ''),
    (2129303, 1, ''),
    (2129303, 2, ''),
    (2129304, 0, 'Create your own beats and tracks by combining these sound FX in  your room. Throw a concert for your friends or even start a band in Habbo!'),
    (2129304, 1, ''),
    (2129304, 2, ''),
    (2129306, 0, ''),
    (2129306, 1, ''),
    (2129306, 2, ''),
    (2129307, 0, 'Triggers let you define what needs to happen for an Effect to take place. To program a Trigger, place it in a room, double click on it and set it up! You need to stack an Effect with the Trigger to make it work.'),
    (2129307, 1, ''),
    (2129307, 2, ''),
    (2129308, 0, 'Effects are what happens after you activate a Trigger. To program an Effect, place it in your room, double click on it and set it up! You will always need to stack a Trigger with the Effect to make it work.'),
    (2129308, 1, ''),
    (2129308, 2, ''),
    (2129309, 0, 'Conditions are specific things that need to be done before a Trigger will work. If you want to use a Condition, you will need to stack it with a Trigger and Effect.'),
    (2129309, 1, ''),
    (2129309, 2, ''),
    (2129310, 0, 'Use Selectors to specify users and/or furni that will be used in Wired. For example, "WIRED Selector: Users in team" combined with "WIRED Effect: Teleport to furni" teleports an entire team at once!'),
    (2129310, 1, ''),
    (2129310, 2, ''),
    (2129311, 0, 'Add-Ons are a special type of Wired that is used to add extra configurations to an existing Wired stack. Each Add-On has its own unique purpose.'),
    (2129311, 1, ''),
    (2129311, 2, ''),
    (2129312, 0, 'Discover a new branch Wired - Wired Variables!'),
    (2129312, 1, 'How do Wired Variables work?'),
    (2129312, 2, 'Variables are used to store values and read them at a later point with Wired. For example, they can be used to store the amount of health points for a user. Variables can belong to users, furni, or even the entire room! You can share them across multiple rooms too. But how do you use them?\n\nWired Variables work different from all existing Wired boxes, because they are not stacked on top of the usual Wired boxes, like Triggers and Effect. Instead, Wired Variables form a new kind of Wired stack (lets call it a "Variable stack"), one that defines how the Variable works.\n\nIn a usual Wired stack, a Wired Effect is stacked on a Wired Trigger. In a Variable stack, there is one "WIRED Variable" and additionally you can add Variable Add-Ons on top of the stack to bring further configurations to the Wired Variable. The boxes that go on a Variable stack all share a similar design, so it''s easy to know if a box belongs on a Variable!'),
    (2129312, 3, ''),
    (2129313, 0, 'The Wired boxes on this page is a combination of the types of Wired you all know and love, like Triggers, Effects and Conditions. The ones on this page are used specifically to work with Wired Variables'),
    (2129313, 1, ''),
    (2129313, 2, ''),
    (2129314, 0, 'Variables are used to store values and read them at a later point with Wired. Variables can belong to users, furni, or even the entire room! You can share them across multiple rooms too.'),
    (2129314, 1, ''),
    (2129314, 2, ''),
    (2129315, 0, 'Variable Add-Ons are used to add extra configurations to an existing Variable stack. Each Variable Add-On has its own unique purpose.'),
    (2129315, 1, ''),
    (2129315, 2, ''),
    (2129316, 0, 'Health bars, boss meters, progress trackers – Variable FX let builders bring numbers to life in Habbo!'),
    (2129316, 1, ''),
    (2129316, 2, ''),
    (2129319, 0, 'Chest Wired can be used to interact with Chests. You can use them to reward players, ask for payments, or initiate trades.'),
    (2129319, 1, ''),
    (2129319, 2, ''),
    (2129320, 0, 'Bring out your inner economist, and write black on white what kind of transaction you want to initiate with the player!'),
    (2129320, 1, ''),
    (2129320, 2, ''),
    (2129321, 0, ''),
    (2129321, 1, ''),
    (2129321, 2, ''),
    (2129322, 0, 'Archived Wired boxes that are still available for legacy reasons, but are not recommended to use in new Wired setups'),
    (2129322, 1, ''),
    (2129322, 2, ''),
    (2129324, 0, 'Design your own custom room layouts with Stack Magic Tiles and Black holes. Stack your items to the ceiling or use them as dividers...the possibilities are endless!'),
    (2129324, 1, ''),
    (2129324, 2, ''),
    (2129325, 0, ''),
